<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00</p>
<p>higher. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>		 Shipment 272 lbs    58.50</p>
<p>US 2-4	290-310 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>US 1-2 package  210 lbs    56.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 500 lbs 1.00 higher; over 500 lbs steady, instances</p>
<p>0.50 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-700 lbs    48.00, load 554 lbs 48.50</p>
